{"slug":"building-be-your-stories","html":"<h2 id=\"the-vision-behind-be-your-stories\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>The Vision Behind Be Your Stories</span><a href=\"#the-vision-behind-be-your-stories\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">In digital content creation, writers and readers frequently face fragmented experiences: web platforms often lack mobile polish, while standalone mobile apps isolate desktop authors.</p><p class=\"text-pretty\"><strong>Be Your Stories (BYS)</strong> was engineered to solve this dilemma by providing a unified digital ecosystem across Web, iOS, and Android. The primary goal was clear:</p><ol>\n<li>Provide an instantaneous, distraction-free reading experience.</li>\n<li>Empower creators with rich formatting, draft persistence, and seamless discovery.</li>\n<li>Guarantee that readers can access their library offline regardless of network conditions.</li>\n</ol><h2 id=\"architectural-foundation\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Architectural Foundation</span><a href=\"#architectural-foundation\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">To deliver a snappy experience across desktop browsers, iPads, and mobile phones, we architected the system with three primary principles:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">text</span>\n<button type=\"button\"