%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%90%0A%E2%94%82%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Distributed%20Backend%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%E2%94%82%20%20%20%20%20Serverless%20APIs%20%E2%80%A2%20Authentication%20%E2%80%A2%20Vector%20Search%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%98\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                   Unified Client Layer                 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│        React Native (iOS / Android) + React Web        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                 [Offline-First Sync Engine]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                 Distributed Backend                    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│     Serverless APIs • Authentication • Vector Search    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h3 id=\"1-offline-first-synchronization\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>1. Offline-First Synchronization</span><a href=\"#1-offline-first-synchronization\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Mobile reading happens in planes, subways, and low-connectivity environments. Treating the network as a fragile transport rather than a prerequisite is essential.</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Local Persistence Layer</strong>: Content is cached locally using transactional key-value stores.</li>\n<li><strong>Optimistic UI Updates</strong>: User actions (bookmarking, progress tracking, highlights) commit locally in <code>0ms</code>, appending mutations to an idempotent synchronization queue.</li>\n<li><strong>Delta-Sync Strategy</strong>: When connectivity resumes, the client transmits change deltas with timestamp-based conflict resolution, minimizing network bandwidth and eliminating sync collisions.</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"2-high-speed-discovery-neural-audiobook-narration\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>2. High-Speed Discovery &amp; Neural Audiobook Narration</span><a href=\"#2-high-speed-discovery-neural-audiobook-narration\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Beyond text persistence, reading platforms thrive on content discovery and auditory immersion:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Sub-15ms Meilisearch Full-Text Indexing</strong>: Rather than executing expensive database <code>LIKE</code> queries or complex regex against PostgreSQL, all published stories are ingested into a dedicated Meilisearch cluster. Search queries return ranked, highlighted results across titles, excerpts, and tags in under 15ms.</li>\n<li><strong>AWS Polly Neural Speech Synthesis</strong>: Long-form articles and creative stories can be narrated dynamically. An event-driven AWS Lambda pipeline splits markdown chapters into phonetic SSML paragraphs, calls AWS Polly's neural voice models (generative Camila and Thiago), and stitches the resulting MP3 audio stream to S3 and CloudFront with sub-second time-to-first-byte playback.</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"3-cross-platform-code-sharing\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>3. Cross-Platform Code Sharing</span><a href=\"#3-cross-platform-code-sharing\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Maintaining distinct codebases for Web and Mobile burns velocity. By structuring shared domain logic in TypeScript:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>80%+ Business Logic Parity</strong>: State machines, API contracts, sync queues, and validation schemas are shared across platforms.</li>\n<li><strong>Platform-Native UI Shells</strong>: Responsive layouts adapt gracefully to touch gestures on smartphones, expanded split views on tablets, and mouse interactions on desktop.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">typescript</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%2F%2F%20Core%20synchronization%20contract%20shared%20across%20Web%20%26%20Mobile%0Aexport%20interface%20SyncMutation%3CT%20%3D%20unknown%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20id%3A%20string%3B%0A%20%20entity%3A%20%22story%22%20%7C%20%22progress%22%20%7C%20%22bookmark%22%3B%0A%20%20action%3A%20%22upsert%22%20%7C%20%22delete%22%3B%0A%20%20payload%3A%20T%3B%0A%20%20clientTimestamp%3A%20number%3B%0A%20%20retryCount%3A%20number%3B%0A%7D\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Core synchronization contract shared across Web &amp; Mobile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SyncMutation</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&lt;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&gt; {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entity</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"story\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"progress\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"bookmark\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  action</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"upsert\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"delete\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clientTimestamp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retryCount</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h2 id=\"production-milestones\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Production Milestones</span><a href=\"#production-milestones\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">Shipping across both app stores requires strict attention to platform guidelines:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Apple App Store Review</strong>: Verified strict privacy controls, smooth in-app navigation, and iPad multitasking support (available live under App Store ID <code>id6812739940</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Google Play Store</strong>: Optimized APK/AAB bundle size, managed background worker lifecycle, and verified diverse device form factors through Google Play Closed Beta testing.</li>\n<li><strong>Performance Profiling</strong>: Maintained 60 FPS transitions and sub-100ms cold startup times on budget mobile hardware.</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"key-learnings\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Key Learnings</span><a href=\"#key-learnings\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><ol>\n<li><strong>Start with domain models, not UI screens</strong>: Well-defined entities made multi-platform data syncing straightforward.</li>\n<li><strong>Design for latency</strong>: Instant feedback loops build user trust, especially in reading and writing tools.</li>\n<li><strong>Automate deployment pipelines early</strong>: Fast CI/CD pipelines allow rapid bug fixes and continuous releases across stores.</li>\n</ol><p class=\"text-pretty\"><em>Be Your Stories is currently live on the unified web portal at <a href=\"https://aldeon.app/bys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">aldeon.app/bys</a>, on the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6812739940\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Apple App Store</a>, and via <a href=\"https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.aldeon.beyourstories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Google Play Closed Beta Testing</a>.</em></p>"}
